{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"diagnosis\":\"The proof was replaced by `skip`. Use `ChoiceBisim`: left-choice transitions are matched using the supplied bisimilarity, while transitions from the shared right operand are matched identically using reflexivity.\",\"proof_body\":\"by\\n  intro h\\n  exists @ChoiceBisim _ _ defs\\n  constructor\\n  · exact ChoiceBisim.choice h\\n  intro s1 s2 hr μ\\n  constructor\\n  · intro s1' htr\\n    cases hr with\\n    | choice hbisim =>\\n      unfold lts at *\\n      cases htr with\\n      | choiceL htr =>\\n        obtain ⟨q', htr', hbisim'⟩ := hbisim.follow_fst htr\\n        exact ⟨q', Tr.choiceL htr', ChoiceBisim.bisim hbisim'⟩\\n      | choiceR htr =>\\n        refine ⟨s1', Tr.choiceR htr, ChoiceBisim.bisim ?_⟩\\n        grind [HomBisimilarity.refl]\\n    | bisim hbisim =>\\n      obtain ⟨s2', htr', hbisim'⟩ := hbisim.follow_fst htr\\n      exact ⟨s2', htr', ChoiceBisim.bisim hbisim'⟩\\n  · intro s2' htr\\n    cases hr with\\n    | choice hbisim =>\\n      unfold lts at *\\n      cases htr with\\n      | choiceL htr =>\\n        obtain ⟨p', htr', hbisim'⟩ := hbisim.follow_snd htr\\n        exact ⟨p', Tr.choiceL htr', ChoiceBisim.bisim hbisim'⟩\\n      | choiceR htr =>\\n        refine ⟨s2', Tr.choiceR htr, ChoiceBisim.bisim ?_⟩\\n        grind [HomBisimilarity.refl]\\n    | bisim hbisim =>\\n      obtain ⟨s1', htr', hbisim'⟩ := hbisim.follow_snd htr\\n      exact ⟨s1', htr', ChoiceBisim.bisim hbisim'⟩\"}"}}
